# npm does NOT fall back to .gitignore once this file exists, and the `files`
# whitelist in package.json admits whole directories — so editor/backup cruft
# living inside bin/, src/, or core/ ships in the tarball unless it is named
# here. A v1.0.0-beta.2 pack was carrying a stale 34 kB bin/doflow.js.bak this
# way. test/guards/package.test.js asserts the tree stays clean.
*.bak
*.orig
*.rej
*.swp
*.tmp
*~

# OS + IDE
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/

# Python bytecode from the analyzers bundled under core/shared/skills/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
